   "title": "MODEL GUIDE — READ BEFORE SELECTING",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# MODEL FAMILY: FLUX 3 IMAGE KLEIN\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\ndiffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-int8-convrot.safetensors (distilled, official BFL int8).\n\n**Important:** CLIPLoader = `qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors` with type **flux3** (NOT Krea's qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled); VAELoader = `flux2-vae.safetensors` (not flux2-vae_small); latent = EmptyFlux2LatentImage. Distilled: 16 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple. Write full natural-language captions.\n\n**Editing:** use ComfyUI's built-in template *FLUX 3 Image Klein: editing (distilled)*; it uses these same files.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
